id: SCA-033
title: Gradle/Maven non-standard repository source
category: supply-chain
severity: info
engine: pattern
target:
  filenames: build.gradle build.gradle.kts pom.xml settings.gradle settings.gradle.kts
  exclude_paths: test/ node_modules/ .git/ vendor/
patterns:
  - regex: url\s*['"]https?://[^'"]+['"]
    message: Build file uses custom repository URL — verify it is a trusted source. Non-standard repositories can serve trojanized artifacts.
fix: Document all custom Maven/Gradle repositories. Prefer Maven Central. Use repository mirroring with integrity verification.
